== diags.diag/lambda-escapes-region
BYN3002 8:16 arena `arena` does not live as long as `kept`, which borrows it
  label arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block
  help copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
BYN3002 13:16 the lambda on line 13 does not live as long as `last`, which borrows it
  label the lambda on line 13 is freed at the end of its block
  help copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
